  "description": "Find the kth ancestor of a tree node using binary lifting for O(log N) query time.",
  "target": 2,
  "pseudocode": "1. precompute ancestors[node][i] = 2^i-th ancestor of node\n2. ancestors[node][0] = parent[node]\n3. for i = 1 to logN:\n4.   ancestors[node][i] = ancestors[ancestors[node][i-1]][i-1]\n5. getKthAncestor(node, k):\n6.   for i = 0 to logN:\n7.     if (k & (1 << i)):\n8.       node = ancestors[node][i]",
